{
  "info": {
    "name": "Carrito GraphQL - Cupones de descuento",
    "description": "Coleccion de pruebas para la API GraphQL del carrito (POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql).\n\nAutor: Wilmer Estuardo Vasquez Raxon\n\nVerificaciones automatizadas ademas del codigo HTTP:\n1. Estructura de la respuesta: presencia o ausencia del arreglo errors y del campo data segun el caso.\n2. Mensajes de error o confirmacion: el texto del error coincide con el mensaje esperado.\n3. Recalculo del total: total = subtotal - discount.\n4. Descuento correcto: discount mayor que 0 al aplicar un cupon y 0 al removerlo o ante un error.\n5. Cupon correcto: couponCode coincide con el enviado en la variable y redeemedCodes lo contiene.\n6. Integridad ante errores: el total no cambia cuando el cupon es rechazado.\n7. Tiempos de respuesta: menor a 1000 ms por solicitud.\n\nEjecucion recomendada: Collection Runner en el orden definido. Variables: baseUrl, couponCode, couponMinimo.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000" },
    { "key": "couponCode", "value": "PROMO20" },
    { "key": "couponMinimo", "value": "PROMO20" },
    { "key": "sku", "value": "" },
    { "key": "totalBefore", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Preparacion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Reiniciar datos de demostracion",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Datos de la respuesta",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "// Validaciones",
                  "pm.test('Codigo HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Tiempo de respuesta menor a 1000 ms', () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000));",
                  "pm.test('Sin errores GraphQL', () => pm.expect(body.errors).to.be.undefined);",
                  "pm.test('resetDemo devuelve true', () => pm.expect(body.data.resetDemo).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": { "query": "mutation {\n  resetDemo\n}", "variables": "{}" }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/graphql", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["graphql"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Consultas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener carrito (valido)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Datos de la respuesta",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const cart = body.data.cart;",
                  "",
                  "// Validaciones generales",
                  "pm.test('Codigo HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Tiempo de respuesta menor a 1000 ms', () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000));",
                  "pm.test('Sin errores GraphQL', () => pm.expect(body.errors).to.be.undefined);",
                  "",
                  "// Validaciones de estructura",
                  "pm.test('El carrito contiene items', () => pm.expect(cart.items).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty);",
                  "pm.test('Cada item tiene los campos esperados', () => {",
                  "  cart.items.forEach(i => pm.expect(i).to.include.all.keys('sku', 'name', 'qty', 'unitPrice', 'lineTotal'));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('La moneda esta definida', () => pm.expect(cart.currency).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "",
                  "// Validaciones de calculos",
                  "pm.test('lineTotal = qty * unitPrice', () => {",
                  "  cart.items.forEach(i => pm.expect(Math.abs(i.lineTotal - i.qty * i.unitPrice)).to.be.below(0.01));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('subtotal = suma de lineTotal', () => {",
                  "  const suma = cart.items.reduce((a, i) => a + i.lineTotal, 0);",
                  "  pm.expect(Math.abs(cart.subtotal - suma)).to.be.below(0.01);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('total = subtotal - discount', () => pm.expect(Math.abs(cart.total - (cart.subtotal - cart.discount))).to.be.below(0.01));",
                  "",
                  "// Variable para pruebas posteriores",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('sku', cart.items[0].sku);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "query GetCart {\n  cart {\n    items {\n      sku\n      name\n      qty\n      unitPrice\n      lineTotal\n    }\n    subtotal\n    discount\n    total\n    couponCode\n    redeemedCodes\n    currency\n  }\n}",
                "variables": "{}"
              }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/graphql", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["graphql"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener usuario actual",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Datos de la respuesta",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "// Validaciones",
                  "pm.test('Codigo HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Tiempo de respuesta menor a 1000 ms', () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000));",
                  "pm.test('Sin errores GraphQL', () => pm.expect(body.errors).to.be.undefined);",
                  "pm.test('El usuario contiene los campos esperados', () => pm.expect(body.data.me).to.include.all.keys('id', 'email', 'name'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": { "query": "query Me {\n  me {\n    id\n    email\n    name\n  }\n}", "variables": "{}" }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/graphql", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["graphql"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Cupones - casos positivos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "TC-01 Aplicar cupon valido con variables",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Datos de la respuesta",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const cart = body.data.applyCoupon;",
                  "const code = pm.collectionVariables.get('couponCode');",
                  "",
                  "// Validaciones generales",
                  "pm.test('Codigo HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Tiempo de respuesta menor a 1000 ms', () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000));",
                  "pm.test('Sin errores GraphQL', () => pm.expect(body.errors).to.be.undefined);",
                  "",
                  "// Validaciones del cupon",
                  "pm.test('couponCode coincide con el codigo enviado', () => pm.expect(cart.couponCode).to.eql(code));",
                  "pm.test('redeemedCodes contiene el codigo aplicado', () => pm.expect(cart.redeemedCodes).to.include(code));",
                  "",
                  "// Validaciones de calculos",
                  "pm.test('El descuento es mayor a 0', () => pm.expect(cart.discount).to.be.above(0));",
                  "pm.test('El descuento no supera el subtotal', () => pm.expect(cart.discount).to.be.at.most(cart.subtotal));",
                  "pm.test('total = subtotal - discount', () => pm.expect(Math.abs(cart.total - (cart.subtotal - cart.discount))).to.be.below(0.01));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "mutation ApplyCoupon($code: String!) {\n  applyCoupon(code: $code) {\n    items {\n      sku\n      name\n      qty\n      unitPrice\n      lineTotal\n    }\n    subtotal\n    discount\n    total\n    couponCode\n    redeemedCodes\n    currency\n  }\n}",
                "variables": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{couponCode}}\"\n}"
              }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/graphql", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["graphql"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "TC-09 Remover cupon aplicado",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
